      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. the biometric stuff and the different airside rules sound a bit intimidating though. it feels like there are all these little \"traps\" or things you don't see coming until you're standing in line at the gate. are there any common mistakes or certain \"types\" of travelers that seem to get flagged more often or run into more trouble with these bureaucratic hurdles?",
